WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.668
Tor saw her friends.

2
00:00:09.669 --> 00:00:16.395
They were playing in the park.

3
00:00:16.396 --> 00:00:21.392
"Look what I found!" Tor said.

4
00:00:21.393 --> 00:00:24.673
She reached into her bag.

5
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.211
She pulled out something round.

6
00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:33.517
"That's an egg!" Sara said.

7
00:00:33.518 --> 00:00:37.299
"How did you get it?"

8
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.229
Tor shrugged.

9
00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.114
"I saw some eggs.

10
00:00:41.115 --> 00:00:43.942
I guess nobody wanted them."

11
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.945
Sara shook her head.

12
00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:50.616
"We must return that egg.

13
00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:57.693
Where did you find it?"

14
00:00:57.694 --> 00:01:00.812
Tor shrugged.

15
00:01:00.813 --> 00:01:03.601
"I forget."

16
00:01:03.602 --> 00:01:15.985
"Where did you go today?" Sara asked.

17
00:01:15.986 --> 00:01:27.769
"Lots of places," Tor said.

18
00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:32.026
"Let's follow Tor's footprints," Rex said.

19
00:01:32.027 --> 00:01:40.533
"They'll lead us to the eggs."

20
00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:44.623
Sid led the way.

21
00:01:44.624 --> 00:01:51.298
He swung his tail as he walked.

22
00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:55.741
Sid's tail hit a rock. Bonk!

23
00:01:55.742 --> 00:02:00.766
The rock rolled . . . into Tor!

24
00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:03.267
"Oh no!" Tor cried.

25
00:02:03.268 --> 00:02:07.483
"My egg!"

